      "children": [
        {
          "text": "Today, you'll be introduced to working with sound in poetry. In order to navigate this lesson, be sure first that you have received a copy of \"Harlem\" from your instructor. Then, you'll simply read and follow along with the instructions on the page, being sure to read/watch/listen to all the items enclosed."
